      "text": "Spillantini and colleagues report that Lewy bodies and Lewy neurites contain abnormal filamentous alpha-synuclein material. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/18591134/",
      "also": [],
