    },
    {
      "id": "clm:10d1e4449f45083939c361006f998fe523880dfc71f801bbf3c5ffb1bce14fbf",
      "text": "Schweighauser and colleagues report two filament types in the MSA brains studied, each composed of two different protofilaments. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-020-2317-6",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:71243063e037b1ba1d41d036783e7cb30cf764c9f7cd096cce656045a9390191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:2484d481e6b288c2f0f433803886ad04528b730e173f52aba83853d11ba8ccc1",
      "text": "Spillantini and colleagues classify Parkinson's disease, dementia with Lewy bodies and multiple system atrophy as alpha-synucleinopathies; Shahnawaz and colleagues likewise group them as diseases associated with \u03b1-synuclein misfolding and aggregation. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/18591134/",
      "also": [
        "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-020-1984-7"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:3ee4c2d206c1cd22ae914263edeaea5f167be85e5d1fa88c061bfc01a26f9d18",
        "ev:a4985a5023c6806a3a88cdcea0d3ba2b1febb14c65e45b3c61bb9a6382928099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:2ac445f6f129f0f003469cb5d9e963d5eba5b773ea97ea64f76c10665acc7f09",
      "text": "Shahnawaz and colleagues note that clinical differentiation of Parkinson\u2019s disease and multiple system atrophy is challenging, particularly early in disease. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-020-1984-7",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:5b8303bbfca8c8b50efd1af25902f6f785357518b3bc03fbb04eb9262cb812ee"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:34ccf526ceacdc3bca8396b565d47db52e0d67879867c0fdb86ee53a577cb284",
      "text": "Shahnawaz and colleagues report that their \u03b1-synuclein-PMCA assay discriminated cerebrospinal fluid samples from patients diagnosed with Parkinson\u2019s disease from those with multiple system atrophy. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-020-1984-7",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:1b4f7b9f114a469477f16e41ba3423286b3fdc1ac57620dc98b8023c584dc34e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:0e856409e1c5c282d4aa0fafce16c75afef523b87bb8db76be5f401a6f941e66",
      "text": "Schweighauser and colleagues report that MSA brain-extracted \u03b1-synuclein filament structures differ from structures formed in vitro using recombinant proteins. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-020-2317-6",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:9395a7a8791a5429d17434e8d5005224cacf590aa791f78148501206f989ea7c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:9ecb757fd62f09a538caa7aaa494df5d68f6ed9b25c6503c4da6e32f2f3d5efd",
      "text": "Yang and colleagues describe MSA \u03b1-synuclein inclusions as especially prominent in oligodendrocytes, consistent with the glial cytoplasmic inclusions described by Spillantini and colleagues. (medium confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-05319-3",
      "also": [
        "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/18591134/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:6b061fefa5007ca39e4eec8c5aebd6c18df83b69a929de00709d5823bb98c16b",
        "ev:c91fabd6104ba6e6252b0e0a90f62bf73b36d77f97d15c721aacb5786008ffb3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:162d25dbacf16e9e9278bb69f2dc7fcf8f90405ceb5180ba65c4ef7ea173e99d",
      "text": "Lee and colleagues describe neuronal soma Lewy bodies and axonal or dendritic Lewy neurites in PD, PDD and DLB. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://elifesciences.org/articles/92775",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:2af14d2c2f02ea3e072300987bdd20b89ded463594198e26887f0649ef60abe6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:6f69cfa60003843446a28211ef3f79df84c8b0024b487f9619f77e3b55f710b1",
      "text": "Yang and colleagues report a single-protofilament Lewy fold in \u03b1-synuclein filaments extracted from the brains of individuals with PD, PDD and DLB. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-05319-3",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:9fb9c029a5913a1c66d473ece43835dfc07a7c95960f4568ebe2ecfdd50e92c3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:6597e2e150444a579a14df5fb95d1d10b1876625ff9992aef5c9b13feed1b91b",
      "text": "Schweighauser and colleagues report non-proteinaceous molecules at the protofilament interface in each MSA filament type studied. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-020-2317-6",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
