    },
    {
      "id": "clm:c1ba398230ad954170477cf0169687d2f9529d8ca5cafbeca9526725baf9b7b6",
      "text": "Lee and colleagues report that their SAA fibrils failed to adopt the biochemical, structural and post-translational modification properties of the brain-derived seed fibrils. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://elifesciences.org/articles/92775",
      "also": [],
