      "canonicalConceptId": "concept:24c1a6a65d83f5c0a58260392d44777ed808dcb6d6d5fb0b252e8df589f5783d",
      "text": "Parkinson\u2019s disease, dementia with Lewy bodies and multiple system atrophy share \u03b1-synuclein inclusion pathology. Their cellular distribution and extracted filament structures distinguish Lewy pathology from MSA. The cited human-brain studies and amplification experiments support molecular diversity within this disease family. Amplified fibrils require cautious interpretation because the cited comparison found incomplete reproduction of brain-derived seed properties.",
